    "description": "FS-1 Rev 1: Laffs Dynamics\n\nRevision of the original Laffs Dynamics FS-1 picatinny attachable buttstock. Much beefier than the original design; extra material around \nthe mounting section, much less material internally towards the rear. \n\nComes in two variants; a four slot mount and five slot taking advantage of some firearms having more picatinny rail space. \n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 7+\nInfill: 40%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 18%\n\n(Use infill blockers on the inside of the buttstock, as it is semi-hollow.)\n\n\n\nHardware Required:\n\n2x M4x30mm Bolt (Can be ground down to 28mm, so it doesn't stick out the side)\n\n2x M4 Hex Nut",
